HEAD of a pull request at the moment it was reviewed. Base commit: 26b975e3282bf02ef907d6e1091e4d36eed9e4c6. Head commit: 5fda964770d6b333ca73eb377860734fbabcb0be (current HEAD).
Inspect the change with `git diff 26b975e3282bf02ef907d6e1091e4d36eed9e4c6..5fda964770d6b333ca73eb377860734fbabcb0be` and by reading code at head and at base (`git show 26b975e3282bf02ef907d6e1091e4d36eed9e4c6:<path>`).
